    "Pick a rep range that matches your goal: strength usually sits around 1–3 reps, hypertrophy is often 8–12 reps, endurance is commonly 12–20+ reps." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wähle einen Wiederholungsbereich, der zu deinem Ziel passt: Kraft liegt meist bei 1–3 Wdh., Hypertrophie oft bei 8–12 Wdh., Ausdauer häufig bei 12–20+ Wdh."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pick a rep range that matches your goal: strength usually sits around 1–3 reps, hypertrophy is often 8–12 reps, endurance is commonly 12–20+ reps."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Elige un rango de repeticiones acorde a tu objetivo: la fuerza suele estar en 1–3 reps, la hipertrofia a menudo en 8–12 reps, la resistencia normalmente en 12–20+ reps."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Choisis une plage de répétitions adaptée à ton objectif : la force se situe généralement autour de 1–3 reps, l'hypertrophie souvent 8–12 reps, l'endurance souvent 12–20+ reps."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scegli un intervallo di ripetizioni adatto al tuo obiettivo: per la forza di solito sono 1–3 ripetizioni, per l'ipertrofia spesso 8–12, per la resistenza in genere 12–20+."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "目標に合ったレップ範囲を選びましょう。筋力向上は1〜3レップ、筋肥大は8〜12レップ、持久力は12〜20レップ以上が目安です。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "목표에 맞는 횟수 범위를 고르세요. 근력은 보통 1–3회, 근비대는 8–12회, 근지구력은 12–20회 이상이에요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Escolha um intervalo de repetições que combine com sua meta: força costuma ficar em 1–3 reps, hipertrofia muitas vezes em 8–12 reps, resistência geralmente em 12–20+ reps."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Выберите диапазон повторений под свою цель: сила — обычно 1–3 повторения, гипертрофия — часто 8–12, выносливость — как правило 12–20+."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "选择符合你目标的次数区间：力量通常在 1–3 次，增肌常见 8–12 次，耐力一般是 12–20 次以上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pick one rep target that matches your goal: strength often uses a low target like 3 reps, hypertrophy is often around 10 reps, endurance is usually 15+ reps." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wähle ein Wiederholungsziel, das zu deinem Ziel passt: Kraft nutzt oft ein niedriges Ziel wie 3 Wdh., Hypertrophie liegt oft bei etwa 10 Wdh., Ausdauer meist bei 15+ Wdh."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pick one rep target that matches your goal: strength often uses a low target like 3 reps, hypertrophy is often around 10 reps, endurance is usually 15+ reps."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Elige un único objetivo de repeticiones acorde a tu meta: la fuerza suele usar un objetivo bajo como 3 reps, la hipertrofia a menudo ronda las 10 reps, la resistencia normalmente 15+ reps."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Choisis un objectif de répétitions adapté à ton but : la force utilise souvent un objectif bas comme 3 reps, l'hypertrophie souvent autour de 10 reps, l'endurance généralement 15+ reps."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scegli un target di ripetizioni adatto al tuo obiettivo: per la forza spesso si usa un target basso come 3 ripetizioni, per l'ipertrofia circa 10, per la resistenza di solito 15+."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "目標に合ったレップ目標を1つ選びましょう。筋力向上は3レップ程度の低め、筋肥大は10レップ前後、持久力は15レップ以上が一般的です。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "목표에 맞는 횟수 하나를 고르세요. 근력은 3회처럼 낮게, 근비대는 10회 안팎, 근지구력은 보통 15회 이상이에요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Escolha uma meta única de repetições que combine com seu objetivo: força costuma usar uma meta baixa como 3 reps, hipertrofia muitas vezes em torno de 10 reps, resistência geralmente 15+ reps."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Выберите одну цель по повторениям под свою задачу: сила — часто около 3 повторений, гипертрофия — около 10, выносливость — обычно 15+."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "选择一个符合你目标的次数：力量常用较低的目标，比如 3 次；增肌常在 10 次左右；耐力通常是 15 次以上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pick the level that best matches your lifting experience. Villain Arc uses this to shape plan defaults and how aggressively suggestions progress." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wähle das Level, das am besten zu deiner Trainingserfahrung passt. Villain Arc nutzt dies, um Planvorgaben und die Aggressivität der Vorschläge zu gestalten."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Elige el nivel que mejor se ajuste a tu experiencia entrenando. Villain Arc lo usa para definir los valores por defecto del plan y cuán agresivamente progresan las sugerencias."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Choisis le niveau qui correspond le mieux à ton expérience. Villain Arc l'utilise pour définir les valeurs par défaut du plan et la progressivité des suggestions."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scegli il livello che rispecchia meglio la tua esperienza con i pesi. Villain Arc lo usa per impostare i valori predefiniti delle schede e quanto aggressivi sono i suggerimenti di progressione."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ご自身のトレーニング経験に最も近いレベルを選んでください。Villain Arcはこれをもとに、プランの初期値と提案の進み方の積極さを調整します。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "운동 경력에 가장 잘 맞는 수준을 고르세요. Villain Arc는 이를 바탕으로 플랜 기본값과 제안이 얼마나 공격적으로 올라갈지 정해요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Escolha o nível que melhor combina com sua experiência de treino. O Villain Arc usa isso para definir os padrões do plano e quão agressivamente as sugestões progridem."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Выбери уровень, который лучше всего отражает твой опыт. Villain Arc учитывает его в настройках планов и в том, насколько быстро растут рекомендации."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "选择最符合你训练经验的水平。Villain Arc 会据此调整计划默认值以及建议的进阶激进程度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
