            "value" : "VILLAIN ARC"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Villain Arc can export your completed workouts to Apple Health as well as read other workout metrics to improve suggestions and make the overall app richer." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Villain Arc kann deine abgeschlossenen Workouts zu Apple Health exportieren und außerdem andere Workout-Metriken lesen, um Vorschläge zu verbessern und die App insgesamt umfangreicher zu machen."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Villain Arc can export your completed workouts to Apple Health as well as read other workout metrics to improve suggestions and make the overall app richer."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Villain Arc puede exportar tus entrenamientos completados a Apple Salud, además de leer otras métricas de entrenamiento para mejorar las sugerencias y enriquecer la app en general."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Villain Arc peut exporter tes séances terminées vers Apple Santé et lire d'autres statistiques de séance pour améliorer les suggestions et enrichir l'app dans son ensemble."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Villain Arc può esportare i tuoi allenamenti completati in Apple Health e leggere altri dati di allenamento per migliorare i suggerimenti e rendere l'app più completa."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Villain Arcは、完了したワークアウトをApple Healthに書き出せるほか、他のワークアウトの指標を読み取って提案の精度を高め、アプリ全体をより充実させます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Villain Arc는 완료한 운동을 Apple Health로 내보낼 수 있고, 다른 운동 지표를 읽어 제안을 개선하고 앱을 더 풍부하게 만들어요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O Villain Arc pode exportar seus treinos concluídos para o Apple Saúde e também ler outras métricas de treino para melhorar as sugestões e tornar o app mais rico."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Villain Arc может экспортировать завершённые тренировки в Apple Health и читать другие показатели, чтобы улучшать рекомендации и делать приложение полезнее."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Villain Arc 可以把你完成的训练导出到 Apple Health，也可以读取其他训练指标来改进建议，让整个应用更丰富。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Villain Arc can use this to shape plan defaults, suggestions, and future coaching around how you like to train." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Villain Arc kann dies nutzen, um Planvorgaben, Vorschläge und zukünftiges Coaching daran auszurichten, wie du gern trainierst."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Villain Arc puede usar esto para adaptar los valores por defecto del plan, las sugerencias y el coaching futuro a cómo te gusta entrenar."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Villain Arc peut l'utiliser pour adapter les valeurs par défaut du plan, les suggestions et le coaching futur à ta façon de t'entraîner."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Villain Arc può usarlo per adattare i valori predefiniti delle schede, i suggerimenti e il coaching futuro al modo in cui ti piace allenarti."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Villain Arcはこれをもとに、あなたのトレーニングの好みに合わせてプランの初期値、提案、今後のコーチングを調整します。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Villain Arc는 이를 바탕으로 플랜 기본값, 제안, 앞으로의 코칭을 내 훈련 스타일에 맞춰요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O Villain Arc pode usar isso para ajustar os padrões do plano, as sugestões e o coaching futuro à forma como você gosta de treinar."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Villain Arc использует это, чтобы подстроить настройки планов, рекомендации и будущие подсказки под твой стиль тренировок."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Villain Arc 会据此调整计划默认值、建议以及未来的指导，贴合你喜欢的训练方式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Villain Arc couldn't access your iCloud account. Make sure you're signed in to iCloud and that CloudKit access isn't restricted." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Villain Arc konnte nicht auf dein iCloud-Konto zugreifen. Stelle sicher, dass du bei iCloud angemeldet bist und der CloudKit-Zugriff nicht eingeschränkt ist."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Villain Arc couldn't access your iCloud account. Make sure you're signed in to iCloud and that CloudKit access isn't restricted."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Villain Arc no pudo acceder a tu cuenta de iCloud. Asegúrate de haber iniciado sesión en iCloud y de que el acceso a CloudKit no esté restringido."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Villain Arc n'a pas pu accéder à ton compte iCloud. Assure-toi d'être connecté à iCloud et que l'accès à CloudKit n'est pas restreint."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Villain Arc non è riuscito ad accedere al tuo account iCloud. Assicurati di aver effettuato l'accesso a iCloud e che l'accesso a CloudKit non sia limitato."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Villain ArcはiCloudアカウントにアクセスできませんでした。iCloudにサインインしていること、CloudKitへのアクセスが制限されていないことを確認してください。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Villain Arc가 iCloud 계정에 접근하지 못했어요. iCloud에 로그인되어 있고 CloudKit 접근이 제한되지 않았는지 확인하세요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O Villain Arc não conseguiu acessar sua conta do iCloud. Verifique se você está conectado ao iCloud e se o acesso ao CloudKit não está restrito."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Villain Arc не смог получить доступ к твоей учётной записи iCloud. Убедись, что вход в iCloud выполнен и доступ к CloudKit не ограничен."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Villain Arc 无法访问你的 iCloud 账户。请确认你已登录 iCloud，并且 CloudKit 访问未受限制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Villain Arc needs additional Apple Health permissions to enable new features it has added and future Health features as they roll out." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Villain Arc benötigt zusätzliche Apple-Health-Berechtigungen, um seit deinem letzten Update hinzugefügte Funktionen zu aktivieren und zukünftige Health-Funktionen zu unterstützen."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Villain Arc needs additional Apple Health permissions to enable features added since your last update and support future Health features."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Villain Arc necesita permisos adicionales de Apple Salud para habilitar las funciones añadidas desde tu última actualización y admitir futuras funciones de Salud."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Villain Arc a besoin d'autorisations Apple Santé supplémentaires pour activer les fonctionnalités ajoutées depuis ta dernière mise à jour et prendre en charge les futures fonctionnalités Santé."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Villain Arc ha bisogno di altri permessi di Apple Health per attivare le funzioni aggiunte dall'ultimo aggiornamento e supportare quelle future."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "前回のアップデート以降に追加された機能を使えるようにし、今後のHealth機能に対応するため、Villain ArcにはApple Healthの追加のアクセス許可が必要です。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Villain Arc가 지난 업데이트 이후 추가된 기능을 쓰고 앞으로의 건강 기능을 지원하려면 Apple Health 권한이 더 필요해요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O Villain Arc precisa de permissões adicionais do Apple Saúde para habilitar os recursos adicionados desde sua última atualização e dar suporte a recursos futuros da Saúde."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Villain Arc нужны дополнительные разрешения Apple Health для функций, появившихся с момента прошлого обновления, и для будущих возможностей Здоровья."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Villain Arc 需要额外的 Apple Health 权限，以启用你上次更新后新增的功能，并支持未来的健康功能。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Villain Arc needs WiFi for first time setup to sync your workout data." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Villain Arc benötigt für die Ersteinrichtung WLAN, um deine Workout-Daten zu synchronisieren."
          }
